item.description:
*Originally posted on Facebook, July 14, 2016*

We, as created creatures of our Creator
belong to Christ and the Father 100%.
We are the image of Christ and the Father only;
In sin and holiness;
In good and evil;
No matter what we do
We are merely clay in our Creator's hand;
one in the faith and mercy
and identity
of Christ and our Father.

*Originally posted on Facebook, July 17, 2016*

"Marvelous in her shrewdness and cunning is the Roman Church. She can read what is to be. She bides her time, seeing that the Protestant churches are paying her homage in their acceptance of the false sabbath and that they are preparing to enforce it by the very means which she herself employed in bygone days. "
{Great Controversy 580.1}

*Originally posted on Facebook, January 9, 2017*

Proverbs 27:6  Faithful are the wounds of a friend;
but the kisses of an enemy are deceitful.

*Originally posted on Facebook, January 18, 2017*

Perfect Love;
the Word of God;
Jesus' Holy Spirit of Truth -
casts out all fear, and every shadow.

*Originally posted on Facebook, January 21, 2017*

Psalms 6:2 Have mercy upon me, O LORD;
for I am weak:
O LORD, heal me;
for my bones are vexed.
41:4 I said, LORD, be merciful unto me:
heal my soul;
for I have sinned against Thee.
60:2 Thou hast made the earth to tremble;
Thou hast broken it:
heal the breaches thereof;
for it shaketh.
Ecclesiastes 3:3 A time to kill, and a time to heal;
a time to break down, and a time to build up;
Isaiah 19:22 And the LORD shall smite Egypt:
he shall smite and heal it:
and they shall return even to the LORD,
and He shall be intreated of them, 
and shall heal them.
Matthew 8:7 And Jesus saith unto him,
I will come,
and heal him.
